``` --- 1. TUNABLE SCOPE & EXCLUSIONS (Customize index, exclusions, and thresholds) --- ```
index=wineventlog sourcetype="WinEventLog:Security" EventCode=4769
    Ticket_Encryption_Type=0x17
    Service_Name!="*$"
    Service_Name!="krbtgt"
    Account_Name!="*$"
    NOT Account_Name IN ("svc_vuln_scanner", "svc_legacy_example")

``` --- 2. FIELD NORMALIZATION & TIME BUCKETING --- ```
| eval Client_IP=replace(Client_Address, "^::ffff:", "")
| bin _time span=10m

``` --- 3. AGGREGATION & TUNABLE THRESHOLDS --- ```
| stats
    count AS total_tgs_requests,
    dc(Service_Name) AS unique_spn_count,
    values(Service_Name) AS targeted_services
    BY _time, Account_Name, Client_IP
| eval min_unique_spns=3, min_total_tgs=5
| where unique_spn_count >= min_unique_spns OR total_tgs_requests >= min_total_tgs

``` --- 4. TRIAGE OUTPUT --- ```
| sort - unique_spn_count, - total_tgs_requests
| table _time, Account_Name, Client_IP, unique_spn_count, total_tgs_requests, targeted_services
